{"id":"n78315-1-7","stage":5,"title":"참배 · 拜","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78315-1-7-1","ko":"어디에 갔다 오셨어요?","zh":"您去哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디에","meaning":"一个地方","explanation":"어디：一个地方；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"2","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔다","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오셨어요?","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"一个地方","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代没有向听话人表明的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/21ea1271c8ddd28993f6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78315-1-7-2","ko":"제가 믿는 신을 모신 곳에 참배를 하러 갔다 왔어요.","zh":"我去拜祭我信仰的神明所在的地方了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"믿는","meaning":"信，信仰","explanation":"믿다：信，信仰；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"믿다","audio":"/audio/03fdf42bef953df48966.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69478","senseId":"3","lemma":"믿다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신을","meaning":"上帝，神","explanation":"신：上帝，神；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"신","audio":"/audio/e609f3d29b9f741ae96e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13993","senseId":"1","lemma":"신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모신","meaning":"供奉，安放，安顿","explanation":"모시다：供奉，安放，安顿；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"모시다","audio":"/audio/64829bc709a905af727b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64703","senseId":"5","lemma":"모시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳에","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참배를","meaning":"拜，参拜","explanation":"참배：拜，参拜；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"참배","audio":"/audio/21b5979c1add531e52c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78315","senseId":"1","lemma":"참배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하러","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔다","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔어요.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"